    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/730620/extras/e5fcd596ffde0e4ed8aff25782c401bb.avif?t=1731171295\" /></div><br><br><strong>Hammer 2 Reloaded is an action game in the third person where you will incarnate Hammer a hero of modern times! Take your rifle and kill anyone who gets in your way!</strong><br><br>Take up arms and kill anyone who gets in your way! Use the land and vehicles to your advantage during your missions! To make a perfect score, you will have to: get the highest score, complete the mission in a specific time, and find the secret package!<br><br><strong><i>Can you kill all the enemies and finish the game 100%?</i></strong><br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><br>\u25a0 A unique design!<br>\u25a0 More than 30 crazy missions!<br>\u25a0 10 successes to unlock in game!<br>\u25a0 Many vehicles to build!<br>\u25a0 A completely destructible map!<br>\u25a0 Various weapons for even more carnage!<br>\u25a0 A multitude of enemies to fight!<br>\u25a0 Ambient music to immerse you in the action!<br>\u25a0 An addictive gameplay!",
